---

---

<section class="section_contact-v3-faq">
        <div class="section-gap">
          <div class="container-main">
            <div class="home-v3-faq-wrapper">
              <div class="section-header is-center">
                <div class="section-header-title-block is-center">
                  <div class="section-eyebrow">
                    <div class="section-eyebrow-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" height="100%" width="100%">
                        <path fill="currentColor" d="M10 0C10.75 6.25 13.75 9.25 20 10C13.75 10.75 10.75 13.75 10 20C9.25 13.75 6.25 10.75 0 10C6.25 9.25 9.25 6.25 10 0Z"></path>
                      </svg></div>
                    <div class="section-eyebrow-label">FAQ</div>
                  </div>
                  <h2 class="heading-style-2 section-header-heading is-wide">Common Questions, Clearly <span class="heading-accent">Answered<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 306 16" height="100%" width="100%" class="heading-accent-line is-pos-faq-center heading-accent-line">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M1.42285 7.96246C96.6187 6.33255 202.147 3.51953 297.986 3.51953"></path>
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M109.064 12.4052C174.391 12.0302 239.535 10.753 304.576 9.7395"></path>
                      </svg></span></h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="home-v3-faq-list">
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="base" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">What consulting services do you provide?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">We advise across business strategy, financial advisory, operations and performance, digital transformation, customer experience and growth strategy, shaped around the decisions your leadership team needs to make next.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="base" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How do you approach a new project?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Every engagement starts with a short discovery phase. We interview your leadership team, review the numbers and agree on the questions that matter most. From there we share a clear plan with scope, milestones and the people involved before any work begins.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="base" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Can your services be customized?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. We do not sell fixed packages. Each engagement is scoped around your goals, budget and timeline, whether you need a focused two-week diagnostic or a partner embedded with your team for a full transformation programme.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="base" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How long does a typical engagement take?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Most strategy and diagnostic projects run six to twelve weeks. Implementation and transformation work usually spans three to nine months, delivered in clear phases so you see measurable progress at every stage.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="base" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you work with startups and growing companies?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Absolutely. Around half of our clients are founder-led or scaling businesses. We help them build the planning, finance and operating rhythms they need to grow without losing focus or control.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="base" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How do you measure project success?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">We agree on a small set of outcome metrics at the start, such as margin, cycle time, retention or cash conversion, and track them throughout the engagement. Success means your team can sustain the results after we step back.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-wf--faq-item--variant="border-none" class="faq-item">
                  <div class="faq-item-bg"></div>
                  <div class="faq-item-line w-variant-477ec841-2364-5ba9-ef2c-f6aa46955002"></div><button type="button" class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Can we start with a strategy consultation?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon"><span class="faq-icon-closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M8 3V13M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span><span class="faq-icon-open"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="faq-icon-svg">
                          <path d="M3 8H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                        </svg></span></span></button>
                  <div class="faq-answer">
                    <div class="faq-answer-inner">
                      <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. A free 45-minute consultation with one of our partners is the best first step. We will discuss your priorities, share initial thoughts and outline how we could help, with no obligation to continue.</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
